OL,3,GNEWSA'I entered foster care at 14 and
OL,4,Ait saved my life'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who entered care at 14 says her
OL,7,Ffoster parents gave her stability, love
OL,8,Fand a future she never thought
OL,9,Fpossible.
OL,11,FThe number of foster carers has fallen
OL,12,Fby 12% since 2021 while the number of
OL,13,Fchildren needing care continues to
OL,14,Frise.
OL,16,FThe government has initiated a campaign
OL,17,Fto get 10,000 more foster care places.
OL,18,FMinisters are promoting regional
OL,19,Ffostering hubs set up in recent years,
OL,20,Fincluding in the South West.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
