OL,3,GNEWSA'I entered foster care at 14 and
OL,4,Ait saved my life'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Fostering definitely saved my life. If
OL,7,FI wasn't fostered I don't know who I'd
OL,8,Fhave ended up with," said Amy Burns,
OL,9,Fwho was there for the launch at Downing
OL,10,FStreet.
